```mermaid
flowchart TD
    zh[Chinese Markdown Updated] --> mt[Machine Translation Placeholder]
    mt --> review[Human Review & Editing]
    review --> approved[Approved English Page]
    approved --> deploy[Publish to Site]
    approved --> monitor[Parity Crawler Nightly]
    monitor -->|Missing / Outdated| backlog[Localization Backlog]
    backlog --> mt
    zh --> sync[Structure Mirror Script]
    sync --> en[docs/en/** Placeholder Files]
    en --> review
    switch[Language Switcher Action] --> check{English Page Available?}
    check -->|Yes| en
    check -->|No| fallback[Fallback Redirect & Log]
    fallback --> monitor
```
